            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1047763?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR addresses the following feedback raised in another PR.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/rebloor/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/rebloor\">@rebloor</a> can we add a note stating Firefox does not support generating a <code class=\"notranslate\">service_worker</code> based in the <code class=\"notranslate\">scripts</code> key? This is something currently only supported by Apple.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><em>Originally posted by <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/carlosjeurissen/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/carlosjeurissen\">@carlosjeurissen</a> in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2819768304\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/25808\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/25808/hovercard?comment_id=2627793381&amp;comment_type=issue_comment\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/25808#issuecomment-2627793381\">#25808 (comment)</a></em></p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">N/A</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2819768304\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/25808\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/25808/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/25808\">#25808</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1930334\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bugzilla 1930334: Implement background.preferred_environment</a></li>\n</ul>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/26164",
